    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22029" root="شرب" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرْبٌ</span></b>  an inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَرِبَ</span> [q. v.]. (S, A, Msb, K,
&amp;c.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And a pl., (S, Msb,) or [rather] a quasipl. n., (ISd, TA,) of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَارِبٌ</span>, q. v. (S, ISd, Msb,
TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  [Golius assigns to it also the meaning
of “ <i>Linum tenue,</i> ” as on the authority of Meyd.]

